  {
   "section": "st",
   "items": [
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 0,
     "text": "Immerse yourself in our world of energy, mobility and IoT"
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 1,
     "text": "Our stories"
    },
    {
     "role": "heading",
     "order": 2,
     "text": "Immerse yourself in our world of energy, mobility and IoT"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 3,
     "text": "You will learn how our semiconductor solutions make mobility clean, safe and smart, the Internet of Things intelligent and secure, and energy efficient."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 4,
     "text": "We turn intelligence into motion. From robots to physical AI."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 5,
     "text": "Your hand switches from a gentle grip on an egg to a firm hold on a box without a second thought. A robot needs tactile sensing, motor control and power working together to do the same. The AI model supplies the intelligence, and thousands of chips turn it into motion. We provide the electronics around the AI compute, from power, motor control, sensing and connectivity to safety and security."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 6,
     "text": "Robotics"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 7,
     "text": "Article"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Nov 16th, 2026"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "AURIX™ RC1: Redefining real-time compute and control"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 10,
     "text": "We are redefining real time compute and control for next-generation SDV, SDX and Physical AI applications. As the trusted global #1 in automotive microcontrollers, we bring the next level of performance, scalability, safety and security, power efficiency, connectivity and edge AI to electronic designs. Our next-generation AURIX™ RC1 microcontrollers help accelerate, scale and enhance innovation. They are built on our future-ready RISC-V multicore real-time cluster architecture."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 11,
     "text": "Software-defined..."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 12,
     "text": "Article"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 13,
     "text": "Nov 3rd, 2026"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 14,
     "text": "Bringing artificial intelligence into everyday life"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 15,
     "text": "Smart living is about bringing artificial intelligence closer to everyday life – from homes and health devices to smartphones and wearables. By combining sensors, microcontrollers, power solutions, connectivity, security and edge AI, Infineon enables devices that can sense, understand and respond to the world around them. The result: experiences that are more intuitive, healthier, safer and more sustainable."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 16,
     "text": "Smart living"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 17,
     "text": "Article"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 18,
     "text": "Oct 28th, 2026"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 19,
     "text": "We make power infrastructure future-proof"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 20,
     "text": "The age of electricity is here – and it demands advanced power infrastructure. As renewable energy scales up, robust power grids are vital to support energy-intensive applications such as AI data centers and modern industries. Infineon semiconductors help meet this need by enabling innovative solutions for optimized power use and grid stability."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 21,
     "text": "Power infrastruc..."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 22,
     "text": "Powerin..."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 23,
     "text": "Article"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 24,
     "text": "Sep 3rd, 2026"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 25,
     "text": "Driving the future of mobility"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 26,
     "text": "Mobility is undergoing one of the most profound transformations in its history. Across the globe, vehicles are becoming electric, connected, and increasingly intelligent. From passenger cars and commercial vehicles to buses, two-wheelers, and rail transport, electrification is reshaping how people and goods move."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 27,
     "text": "Electromobility"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 28,
     "text": "Article"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 29,
     "text": "Sep 2nd, 2026"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 30,
     "text": "We power AI - from grid to core"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 31,
     "text": "We power AI by enabling todays and future generation of energy-efficient (AI) data centers with best-in-class performance, reliability, and lowest total cost of ownership. With our comprehensive semiconductor solutions and system expertise, we support customers in optimizing their data centers - from grid to the core."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 32,
     "text": "Powering AI"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 33,
     "text": "Article"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 34,
     "text": "Sep 1st, 2026"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 35,
     "text": "The transformative power of a software-defined vehicle"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 36,
     "text": "Mobility is undergoing a significant shift. The software-defined vehicle promises a new era of flexibility, efficiency, and adaptability. But how can we navigate this transformation to ensure that the SDV is not only innovative but also safe and reliable? How can we integrate the SDV into our digital lives in a way that meets our needs and expectations?"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 37,
     "text": "Software-defined..."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 38,
     "text": "Article"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 39,
     "text": "Aug 25th, 2026"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 40,
     "text": "The age of electricity calls for semiconductors"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 41,
     "text": "AI data centers and modern industries are driving electricity demand to new highs. Explore the semiconductor innovations redefining energy conversion, control and delivery."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 42,
     "text": "Power infrastruc..."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 43,
     "text": "Video"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 44,
     "text": "Aug 10th, 2026"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 45,
     "text": "The European Cyber Resilience Act: strengthening trust in connected products"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 46,
     "text": "Trust is the foundation of the connected world. The European Cyber Resilience Act is setting new standards for cybersecurity in digital products, pushing security beyond compliance and toward a lasting competitive advantage. Discover what the CRA requires and how Infineon enables customers to build resilient, trusted products from the ground up."
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 47,
     "text": "Security"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 48,
     "text": "Article"
    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 49,
     "text": "Aug 5th, 2026"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 50,
     "text": "Discover more",
     "href": "/content/ifx/en/about/our-stories.html"
    }
   ],
